      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=# Overview\n\nYou are part of the cold email team at a **video editing and personal branding agency** that helps founders, investors, and professionals grow their audience by turning raw videos into high-quality short-form content for platforms like LinkedIn, YouTube, and Instagram.\n\nThe goal is to help busy professionals stay consistent with their personal brand without spending time editing or managing content.\n\n# Task\n\nYour job is to analyze the research found on a prospect (from LinkedIn and the web) to prepare insights for a personalized cold email. You must find the following:\n\n---\n\n### 1. Personalization Opportunities\nIdentify what makes this person or their work unique, so the email can feel personal and relevant.\n\nYou can look for:\n- Content they’ve posted or been featured in.\n- Notable achievements or company milestones.\n- Unique traits in their professional journey or background.\n- Thought leadership topics they care about (e.g., SaaS growth, investing, AI, startups).\n\nEach personalization should be specific enough to prove that we actually looked them up, not AI-generated fluff.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Pain Points & Solutions\nBased on their role, company, and industry, predict the biggest challenges they might face when it comes to building a personal brand or creating consistent video content.\n\nCommon examples:\n- They don’t have time to edit or post regularly.\n- Their video content lacks consistency or quality.\n- They struggle to repurpose their podcasts, webinars, or talks into short-form clips.\n- They want to build credibility online but aren’t sure how to show up consistently.\n\nThen, map each pain point to a clear and actionable solution the agency can provide.\n\nExample offers:\n- End-to-end video editing and repurposing.\n- Short-form clip creation optimized for LinkedIn/YouTube/Instagram.\n- Content calendar and posting support.\n- Personal brand strategy assistance.\n\n---\n\n# Output Format\n\nYour output must be in the following format:\n\n*Personalization*\n\n1. Opportunity: HERE  \n   Supporting Evidence: HERE  \n\n2. Opportunity: HERE  \n   Supporting Evidence: HERE  \n\n(…add more as needed)\n\n⸻\n\n*Pain Points & Solutions*\n\n1. Pain Point: HERE  \n   Supporting Evidence: HERE  \n   Offer: HERE  \n\n2. Pain Point: HERE  \n   Supporting Evidence: HERE  \n   Offer: HERE  \n\nEach “Supporting Evidence” must come directly from the research data provided — ideally a specific quote, LinkedIn post detail, or company mention. Do not write vague or generic content.\n\nIf there’s no personalization available, return “null” for that section.\n\n---\n\n# Complete the analysis for the following prospect.\n\nResearch:\n\n1. Scraped LinkedIn profile in JSON format:  \n   {{ $('Run an Actor and get dataset').item.json.basic_info }}\n\n2. Company research from searching the web:  \n   {{ $json.output }}",
        "options": {}
      },
